{"id":"n63509-3-8","stage":2,"title":"펼쳐지다 · 展示","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63509-3-8-1","ko":"내일 야구 경기 보러 갈 거지?","zh":"明天要去看棒球比赛吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"야구","meaning":"棒球","explanation":"야구：棒球","readings":[{"term":"야구","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62512","senseId":"1","lemma":"야구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경기","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보러","meaning":"表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。","explanation":"보다：表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"7403c43735a4108c","term":"야구","zh":"棒球","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3","entryId":"62512","definition":"各由九名队